  "@id": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23043842",
  "name": "Digital Maturity Framework: provenance-tracked panel of digital-maturity time series (2012-2025)",
  "description": "Annual country series of ten determinants (X1-X10), two controls (C1, C2), the constructed Digital Maturity Index and six context indicators (Z1-Z6) for twelve countries, 2012-2025, with the provenance state, edition and retrieval method of every cell, published as a knowledge graph aligned with RDF Data Cube, PROV-O, SKOS and DCAT.",
  "version": "3.1.0",
  "url": "https://github.com/TeodoraSiljanoska/digital-maturity-framework",
  "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23043842",
  "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
  "isAccessibleForFree": true,
  "creator": [
